# pcre2 10.32 (Red Hat build) bundled inside the opencv-python and psycopg-binary wheels, in
# opencv_python.libs and psycopg_binary.libs. The Debian system library is patched (10.42-1+deb12u2).
# Trivy compares the Red Hat build against Debian advisories, so some of these may already be fixed.
# Accepted risk: exploiting these needs an attacker-controlled regular expression compiled by that
# copy of the library, and the application passes no user input to it. Python's `re` does not use it.
# Review on each dependency update. See verification/security/JUSTIFICATIONS.md.
